{
	"_about": "Hand-curated (not generated by build-public-data). Iconic surfboard models shown by The Volume Gap's 3D hero. Sizes are copied verbatim from the cited pages; every volume carries a volume_status of 'published' (printed on the page) or 'estimated' (computed by estimateVolumeL in src/lib/surf-volume/iconic-boards.ts). Everything under 'shape' is estimated from typical designs of that style, not measured: only length, width, thickness and volume are published. The 3D model calibrates its rail fullness so its mesh volume equals the size's liters exactly. 'labels' are the makers' own brand and model logos (files from each maker's website, listed in 'logos'; trademarks of their owners), placed where the real boards carry them, plus shaper signatures typeset in the site's fonts on the bottoms. Where a real deck carries no model logo (the Sting, In the Pink, Hypto Krypto and Wavestorm) only the maker's logo is shown. Pyzel publishes no file for the White Tiger's crest, so it comes from a retailer's screenshot. The Pipeliner's bolt is painted as a deck inlay, the way Lopez's Lightning Bolt boards carried it.",
